WEBVTT

00:00:01.825 --> 00:00:10.893
<i>GRENADIER</i>

00:00:11.134 --> 00:00:20.634
<i>Carving my footsteps
in the amber colored road...</i>

00:00:20.744 --> 00:00:30.449
<i>... I've finally come this far.
I keep my eyes on the road ahead.</i>

00:00:30.720 --> 00:00:39.856
<i>Only time moves faster than me...</i>

00:00:40.263 --> 00:00:50.400
<i>I look back...
the road behind me shines blue.</i>

00:00:51.408 --> 00:00:57.369
<i>The flames of all the lives
I've encountered...</i>

00:00:57.580 --> 00:01:00.981
<i>I wish I could hold them in my arms.</i>

00:01:01.151 --> 00:01:06.817
<i>So that we don't get swept away
by this great river...</i>

00:01:06.957 --> 00:01:10.484
<i>... I want our hearts to be one.</i>

00:01:10.660 --> 00:01:19.659
<i>We're all travelers, after all.</i>

00:01:33.316 --> 00:01:36.774
<i>BANSHU
KINGDOM OF TARA</i>

00:01:42.826 --> 00:01:45.522
Hold that, will you?

00:01:47.998 --> 00:01:51.058
A well in the center of town. How nice!

00:01:51.201 --> 00:01:56.138
Now you don't have to go to the
outskirts of town to get water, Koto.

00:01:56.239 --> 00:01:58.104
Yes, it's wonderful.

00:01:58.208 --> 00:02:03.942
I heard that seeing the women leave
town every morning to fetch water...

00:02:04.147 --> 00:02:07.742
...inspired the king
to build the well.

00:02:07.884 --> 00:02:09.215
Wow.

00:02:09.486 --> 00:02:12.853
He's such a kind king.

00:02:26.936 --> 00:02:30.463
<i>Episode 2
Rushuna Under Attack</i>

00:02:31.441 --> 00:02:34.535
Mr. Yajiro? Master Yajiro?

00:02:34.677 --> 00:02:36.668
Squire Yajiro?

00:02:37.781 --> 00:02:41.376
No, Yatchan suits you the best!

00:02:46.656 --> 00:02:52.060
Oh, I'm so sweaty.
I wish I could take a bath.

00:02:53.229 --> 00:02:55.754
Will you be joining me again?

00:02:58.134 --> 00:02:59.726
Smile, smile.

00:03:00.003 --> 00:03:01.732
<i>HEARING IS A LITTLE WEAK</i>

00:03:02.672 --> 00:03:07.371
You can't eliminate the
enemy's will to fight with that!

00:03:07.577 --> 00:03:10.910
What? You knew too?

00:03:11.081 --> 00:03:15.916
They were behind you.
Twelve senshi with machine guns.

00:03:16.086 --> 00:03:17.212
Twelve?

00:03:17.454 --> 00:03:20.685
Don't worry, I'll protect you.

00:03:29.199 --> 00:03:30.723
Is it me?

00:03:31.534 --> 00:03:33.126
There's the girl!

00:03:33.236 --> 00:03:34.726
They're after me?

00:03:34.871 --> 00:03:37.465
The 3,000 gold pieces are mine!

00:03:43.713 --> 00:03:47.979
I'm sorry Yatchan, I guess
it was me they were after.

00:03:49.018 --> 00:03:51.509
There're more. Be careful.

00:03:52.055 --> 00:03:54.455
Are they going to shoot again?

00:03:56.893 --> 00:03:58.190
Take this!

00:04:31.060 --> 00:04:34.393
Have I done something to you?

00:04:37.800 --> 00:04:43.067
Beating your enemy without fighting,
huh? Give me a break!

00:04:51.114 --> 00:04:54.572
What's wrong? Feeling guilty
because you had to fight again?

00:04:55.084 --> 00:04:57.245
Is this... me?

00:04:59.822 --> 00:05:05.556
Reward for the capture of this
golden-haired senshi, dead or alive...

00:05:05.929 --> 00:05:08.090
3,000 gold pieces?

00:05:08.198 --> 00:05:12.157
How rude! I do not look this scary!

00:05:12.869 --> 00:05:17.738
I don't know, when you start shooting
you look a little like this!

00:05:19.075 --> 00:05:21.168
Just kidding.

00:05:21.644 --> 00:05:26.104
They assumed you were her,
just because of the color of your hair.

00:05:26.382 --> 00:05:32.184
But because they saw your skills,
they'll be coming after you again.

00:05:32.488 --> 00:05:35.150
Better not go to town!

00:05:35.258 --> 00:05:36.190
Huh?

00:05:36.392 --> 00:05:39.919
Mr. Soldier-men, it's not me!

00:05:40.029 --> 00:05:41.394
Hey!

00:05:41.798 --> 00:05:44.995
Did you hear a word I said?

00:05:45.935 --> 00:05:47.402
Jeez!

00:05:54.310 --> 00:05:58.144
What should I do?
They've got the wrong person!

00:06:00.350 --> 00:06:01.977
What was that?

00:06:04.254 --> 00:06:07.417
Why'd she leave me behind?

00:06:39.055 --> 00:06:41.785
What a way to die.

00:06:44.794 --> 00:06:48.787
These people weren't killed by guns.

00:06:48.898 --> 00:06:52.857
Something with incredible
power cut them down.

00:06:53.036 --> 00:06:56.335
These aren't the marks of any sword.

00:06:56.472 --> 00:07:01.136
This attack was made by
something inhuman.

00:07:13.222 --> 00:07:17.022
Where the hell did she go? Huh?

00:07:17.226 --> 00:07:19.456
<i>BATHHOUSE</i>

00:07:21.898 --> 00:07:25.595
I want to take a bath.
Will you be joining me again?

00:07:33.776 --> 00:07:35.903
He was peeking!

00:07:37.447 --> 00:07:42.146
3,000 gold pieces...
I guess I'll see about this first.

00:07:56.632 --> 00:07:59.294
Something just flew at me.

00:08:00.269 --> 00:08:02.294
I couldn't see it at all.

00:08:07.410 --> 00:08:08.809
Golden hair!

00:08:19.021 --> 00:08:22.582
It almost took my arm off
just by grazing me.

00:08:22.725 --> 00:08:26.252
This is the power that
killed all these men!

00:08:26.662 --> 00:08:29.756
In that case, I won't smile!

00:08:34.704 --> 00:08:37.673
If I stand in front of it, I'm dead!

00:08:50.353 --> 00:08:51.411
Huh?

00:08:52.989 --> 00:08:58.017
Can you tell me a little more
about this 3,000 gold coin bounty?

00:08:58.428 --> 00:09:02.262
Kid, do you know where you are?

00:09:02.398 --> 00:09:03.057
Huh?

00:09:03.499 --> 00:09:06.935
Sure, it's a bar, right?

00:09:07.069 --> 00:09:10.061
It's not just any bar.

00:09:10.339 --> 00:09:14.503
This is the best bar in town,
even the King himself has visited.

00:09:14.610 --> 00:09:17.636
Bad things will happen
if you don't have a drink.

00:09:18.080 --> 00:09:19.377
The King?

00:09:19.515 --> 00:09:23.246
King Furon, the one in the middle.

00:09:25.254 --> 00:09:28.314
What? This country's king is a kid?

00:09:28.458 --> 00:09:31.325
Watch what you say, kid.

00:09:36.098 --> 00:09:38.191
A child?

00:09:38.901 --> 00:09:41.165
Why is a child...

00:09:41.571 --> 00:09:45.166
You... You saw my face!

00:09:53.149 --> 00:09:55.515
I'm hurt.

00:09:56.385 --> 00:10:01.015
Look, I give up, so let's stop.

00:10:01.757 --> 00:10:05.352
No, you saw my face!

00:10:09.298 --> 00:10:11.391
Enough already!

00:10:49.672 --> 00:10:52.505
Oh no!

00:10:52.708 --> 00:10:56.371
Someone! The golden-haired senshi!

00:11:09.759 --> 00:11:15.356
How surprised I was!

00:11:15.498 --> 00:11:20.265
When Koto came bursting in saying
that she'd found the fugitive...

00:11:20.403 --> 00:11:24.703
...I thought the
3,000 gold pieces were mine!

00:11:26.542 --> 00:11:28.840
Koto gets frazzled.

00:11:29.011 --> 00:11:32.378
Lots of people have golden hair!

00:11:33.316 --> 00:11:34.943
You're right.

00:11:35.785 --> 00:11:38.549
I hear she's a traveler.

00:11:41.924 --> 00:11:43.619
Food... Food...

00:11:44.126 --> 00:11:45.991
Sake...

00:11:47.196 --> 00:11:52.725
Kid, you don't have to do that.
We'll take care of her.

00:11:53.202 --> 00:11:56.228
I have no intention of
letting you help us for free.

00:11:56.739 --> 00:12:00.072
I'll pay you back for
your troubles by working.

00:12:00.209 --> 00:12:02.677
That's how I operate.

00:12:03.012 --> 00:12:05.412
Do as you like.

00:12:06.115 --> 00:12:10.211
Mr. Yajiro, your friend is awake.

00:12:15.791 --> 00:12:17.349
Are you okay?

00:12:17.460 --> 00:12:18.561
What happened?

00:12:18.561 --> 00:12:19.926
<i>Ouch.
What happened?</i>

00:12:20.129 --> 00:12:22.996
Are you okay, Rushuna?

00:12:23.299 --> 00:12:26.462
I'm hungry.

00:12:29.438 --> 00:12:32.430
You fought the fugitive?

00:12:35.611 --> 00:12:38.136
That's great!

00:12:38.280 --> 00:12:41.050
The person in the wanted poster?

00:12:41.050 --> 00:12:41.982
<i>Yes!
The person in the wanted poster?</i>

00:12:42.284 --> 00:12:45.617
He attacked me out of nowhere!

00:12:45.755 --> 00:12:47.689
He was really strong!

00:12:47.823 --> 00:12:51.190
Why'd you lose? It's 3,000 gold pieces!

00:12:51.293 --> 00:12:55.525
But Yatchan, he startled me!
I mean, he was...

00:13:04.206 --> 00:13:10.145
Don't talk with your mouth full.
Didn't your mom teach you that?

00:13:10.246 --> 00:13:11.736
Huh...

00:13:12.181 --> 00:13:13.648
This kid!

00:13:13.816 --> 00:13:17.616
The 3,000 gold piece reward
is for his head!

00:13:30.599 --> 00:13:33.693
You're mistaken, little lady.

00:13:33.836 --> 00:13:39.638
That person is King Furon, the kind king
of this country who loves his people.

00:13:39.742 --> 00:13:40.470
What?

00:13:40.609 --> 00:13:43.806
The King will turn seventeen this year.

00:13:43.913 --> 00:13:44.937
Seventeen!

00:13:45.047 --> 00:13:46.036
Yes.

00:13:46.182 --> 00:13:50.642
But due to a childhood illness,
he still looks like a child.

00:13:50.786 --> 00:13:55.416
There is no way he could be
mistaken for a seven-foot fugitive.

00:13:59.695 --> 00:14:02.163
But he had on a strange armor.

00:14:02.264 --> 00:14:03.788
Ms. Rushuna!

00:14:04.066 --> 00:14:08.298
If you don't stop saying those things,
I'm going to get mad!

00:14:10.673 --> 00:14:12.140
<i>Back off.</i>

00:14:12.441 --> 00:14:17.970
You must have hit your head pretty hard.
Maybe you should go back to bed.

00:14:18.147 --> 00:14:18.841
But!

00:14:19.048 --> 00:14:20.345
Rushuna...

00:14:20.983 --> 00:14:24.510
...just go back upstairs and go to bed.

00:14:28.591 --> 00:14:30.115
You're right.

00:14:30.359 --> 00:14:34.352
I think I did hit my head pretty hard.

00:14:40.336 --> 00:14:41.701
I understand.

00:14:41.837 --> 00:14:46.797
The farmers with a bad harvest will
receive subsidies from the castle.

00:14:46.909 --> 00:14:49.776
Thank you, Your Highness!

00:14:54.016 --> 00:14:56.211
Good luck to you.

00:14:58.554 --> 00:15:00.021
Yes!

00:15:03.459 --> 00:15:08.021
Thank you, Your Highness! Thank you!

00:15:09.632 --> 00:15:11.031
You may go.

00:15:24.446 --> 00:15:27.745
Good work with your official duties.

00:15:27.883 --> 00:15:29.084
About this afternoon...

00:15:29.084 --> 00:15:30.676
<i>I heard.
About this afternoon...</i>

00:15:30.786 --> 00:15:35.951
That reward the government
offered has brought bounty hunters...

00:15:36.125 --> 00:15:38.150
...out of the woodwork.

00:15:38.260 --> 00:15:39.124
Yes.

00:15:39.829 --> 00:15:41.990
Do not worry.

00:15:42.164 --> 00:15:46.464
The more you fight, the faster
your powers will grow stronger.

00:15:46.602 --> 00:15:50.163
It's important that
you show off your powers.

00:15:50.306 --> 00:15:52.706
I gather everyone was annihilated...

00:15:52.842 --> 00:15:53.968
No.

00:15:55.744 --> 00:16:01.944
A girl with some impressive skills
saw my face and damaged my armor.

00:16:02.084 --> 00:16:06.145
She put up such a
fight against Your Highness...

00:16:06.355 --> 00:16:09.324
She is not my enemy.

00:16:10.292 --> 00:16:11.418
But...

00:16:13.462 --> 00:16:18.092
I was one step away from finishing
her off, but she got away.

00:16:18.234 --> 00:16:21.101
I was unable to finish her off.

00:16:21.637 --> 00:16:28.042
Don't worry, I will personally
take care of her.

00:16:28.177 --> 00:16:29.109
Good.

00:16:30.045 --> 00:16:33.708
This plan that you have
staked your life upon...

00:16:33.849 --> 00:16:37.808
...I will not let anything
get in the way of it.

00:16:38.554 --> 00:16:40.488
Nothing...

00:16:50.232 --> 00:16:54.191
It's a medicated bath, so hang in there.

00:16:54.336 --> 00:16:57.328
It's the best thing for injuries.

00:16:57.439 --> 00:16:58.167
Okay.

00:17:05.447 --> 00:17:07.915
I think it's working.

00:17:08.017 --> 00:17:10.110
Isn't it nice?

00:17:11.654 --> 00:17:17.024
Mr. Bath boy, you can
make it a little hotter!

00:17:18.160 --> 00:17:20.128
<i>Who're you calling a bath boy?</i>

00:17:23.799 --> 00:17:26.632
Koto, that's really cute.

00:17:26.735 --> 00:17:28.635
This?

00:17:29.171 --> 00:17:33.130
His Majesty Furon gave it to me
when he came to the bar.

00:17:33.275 --> 00:17:34.367
Wow.

00:17:35.945 --> 00:17:39.972
King Furon is always kind to everyone.

00:17:40.115 --> 00:17:45.883
I hope that someday, we will
be able to repay him, but...

00:17:46.221 --> 00:17:47.188
I see...

00:17:47.323 --> 00:17:49.518
That's a lot to wish for, isn't it?

00:17:49.625 --> 00:17:50.557
No.

00:17:54.964 --> 00:18:00.596
Um, Mr. Bath boy,
it's getting a little too hot.

00:18:03.205 --> 00:18:05.435
Do it yourself then!

00:18:08.844 --> 00:18:10.471
What the...

00:18:16.352 --> 00:18:17.376
Rushuna!

00:18:19.588 --> 00:18:20.953
Koto, get down!

00:18:36.972 --> 00:18:39.065
Rushuna, are you okay?

00:18:41.844 --> 00:18:43.937
How pitiful.

00:18:44.079 --> 00:18:46.707
Losing to an enemy of this caliber...

00:18:46.849 --> 00:18:49.317
That kid has a lot to learn.

00:18:50.719 --> 00:18:53.620
Are you that kid's friend?

00:18:53.756 --> 00:18:56.452
And if I was?

00:19:03.399 --> 00:19:06.926
She dodged a close range shot like that!

00:19:09.104 --> 00:19:10.696
You!

00:19:25.888 --> 00:19:27.879
What's so funny?

00:19:28.157 --> 00:19:29.784
Who are you?

00:19:30.125 --> 00:19:31.717
Name yourself!

00:19:31.860 --> 00:19:34.920
Your skills are quite impressive.

00:19:35.064 --> 00:19:40.832
But if you continue like this, it's going to
cause trouble for everyone around you.

00:19:42.371 --> 00:19:46.307
Like that young girl there...

00:19:46.708 --> 00:19:47.538
What?

00:19:55.651 --> 00:19:56.845
Koto...

00:20:09.231 --> 00:20:11.426
He's definitely Furon's...

00:20:11.633 --> 00:20:14.830
...buddy, right? That Jester...

00:20:15.003 --> 00:20:18.200
Yatchan, you can't stop me you know.

00:20:18.340 --> 00:20:19.830
You're not...

00:20:20.109 --> 00:20:24.739
...planning to go up against
the whole castle on your own?

00:20:29.151 --> 00:20:32.917
Who are you? What do you think this is?

00:20:40.496 --> 00:20:43.727
No more smiles tonight.

00:20:47.569 --> 00:20:50.129
Is something the matter?

00:20:50.472 --> 00:20:52.030
I can't sleep.

00:20:52.374 --> 00:20:55.571
My heart is restless.

00:20:56.378 --> 00:20:59.040
Where is Rushuna?

00:20:59.181 --> 00:21:02.241
In Banshu, in the Kingdom of Tara.

00:21:02.451 --> 00:21:06.410
Actually, this has been circulated.

00:21:12.895 --> 00:21:14.453
Intruder!

00:21:14.596 --> 00:21:16.188
Go! Go!

00:21:16.932 --> 00:21:19.799
<i>A golden-haired senshi.</i>

00:21:20.302 --> 00:21:23.863
<i>This senshi is causing
trouble in Tara.</i>

00:21:24.006 --> 00:21:30.570
<i>So, the neighboring countries are afraid
and have cut all relations with Tara.</i>

00:21:30.746 --> 00:21:33.874
<i>But why has such a thing happened?</i>

00:21:34.016 --> 00:21:38.043
<i>Rushuna can get to the bottom of this.</i>

00:21:52.367 --> 00:21:54.927
The golden-haired senshi!

00:21:55.070 --> 00:21:56.697
Her?

00:21:58.407 --> 00:22:01.433
You will let me pass.

00:22:01.944 --> 00:22:04.242
If you get in my way...

00:22:05.547 --> 00:22:07.447
...I will show no mercy.

00:22:16.091 --> 00:22:25.727
<i>All alone,
so many nights I want to cry.</i>

00:22:26.802 --> 00:22:36.473
<i>Everyone dreams on
the road of the endless journey.</i>

00:22:37.779 --> 00:22:43.012
<i>Always believe in something,
and always lose something.</i>

00:22:43.185 --> 00:22:47.246
<i>I hold you.</i>

00:22:48.323 --> 00:22:56.059
<i>All the tears I shed
will turn into kindness.</i>

00:22:56.398 --> 00:22:58.491
<i>I'm sure.</i>

00:22:58.767 --> 00:23:03.898
<i>Don't be defeated by sadness.</i>

00:23:04.106 --> 00:23:09.544
<i>Keep your eye on tomorrow.</i>

00:23:09.745 --> 00:23:19.746
<i>You're not alone.
Everyone has dreams to come true.</i>

00:23:20.088 --> 00:23:30.896
<i>The winds of tomorrow will
bring the fragrance of kindness.</i>

00:23:31.066 --> 00:23:41.670
<i>It's a promise...
I'll always be by your side.</i>

00:23:43.812 --> 00:23:45.780
<i>Next Episode</i>

00:23:45.914 --> 00:23:49.077
The identity of the fugitive
is King Furon, without a doubt.

00:23:49.217 --> 00:23:51.708
But why is the young king doing this?

00:23:51.853 --> 00:23:55.050
The defense plan that
he stakes his life on...

00:23:55.223 --> 00:23:59.125
Is this what it takes for a small country
to survive these war-torn times?

00:23:59.261 --> 00:24:01.957
It doesn't have to be this way!

00:24:02.130 --> 00:24:05.190
Come on, King, we can do it!

00:24:06.034 --> 00:24:10.403
Next episode of "Grenadier",
Enlightened Evil.

00:24:10.539 --> 00:24:13.372
Would you like to join me?
